WEBVTT

00:50.049 --> 00:51.134
ALL FIGURES,
INCIDENTS, LOCATIONS,

00:51.217 --> 00:52.469
ORGANIZATIONS,
AND OTHERS ARE FICTITIOUS.

00:52.552 --> 00:53.970
CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS
WERE FILMED SAFELY

00:54.054 --> 00:54.971
IN ACCORDANCE WITH GUIDELINES.

01:10.528 --> 01:12.363
Lee Tae-geon! Stop right there!

01:14.282 --> 01:15.283
Lee Tae-geon!

01:25.585 --> 01:26.836
Where's Lee Tae-geon?

01:29.756 --> 01:30.799
I lost him.

01:32.008 --> 01:33.384
I'll call the police first.

01:34.219 --> 01:36.971
-Then, I'll go get the recorder back.
-Okay.

01:49.692 --> 01:52.278
OKCHEON BUILDING

01:55.990 --> 01:58.034
What do we do about her?

02:01.287 --> 02:02.205
Do-kyung.

02:04.207 --> 02:07.085
Don't concern yourself.
Just make sure you secure the recorder.

02:17.262 --> 02:20.431
-He stole a recorder and ran off…
-I see.

02:29.858 --> 02:30.859
Hello?

02:30.942 --> 02:32.026
This is Lee Tae-geon.

02:32.652 --> 02:34.612
I've secured the recorder.

03:02.390 --> 03:03.391
He took

03:04.684 --> 03:06.144
the recorder.

03:11.774 --> 03:13.276
They're the Four Dragons Gang.

03:14.110 --> 03:16.529
I know them well
because I put them behind bars.

03:17.530 --> 03:19.407
When I decided to look into you,

03:20.742 --> 03:22.368
someone said

03:23.620 --> 03:27.707
I'd be able to hear about you
if I went to Chinatown.

03:28.666 --> 03:30.084
There,

03:30.168 --> 03:34.839
I heard you took bribes from the gang
in exchange for protection.

03:36.549 --> 03:40.553
That you were more vicious than the gang
to the small business owners.

03:42.513 --> 03:43.473
See you.

03:45.016 --> 03:46.643
The person who sent me there…

03:49.187 --> 03:50.563
was Yang Byung-il.

03:53.566 --> 03:54.692
First off…

03:56.736 --> 03:58.947
let's look for Lee Tae-geon again.

04:00.907 --> 04:04.577
I'd better meet the owner
of the Red House in Chinatown.

04:05.078 --> 04:07.121
He lied to me about you.

04:07.830 --> 04:09.832
That means he's connected to them.

04:18.591 --> 04:21.970
We barely got our hands on that recorder.

04:24.013 --> 04:25.431
It's gone again.

04:29.018 --> 04:31.354
But compared to when we didn't
even get a glimpse of it,

04:32.146 --> 04:33.189
there's hope.

04:36.818 --> 04:38.695
Whoever raised you must be so proud.

04:42.699 --> 04:44.325
I learned from my father.

04:45.285 --> 04:47.954
He's a remarkable man, you see.

05:08.808 --> 05:10.810
TAEBAEK LAW FIRM

05:30.413 --> 05:31.706
The recorder?

05:32.498 --> 05:36.502
Yes, I told Lee Tae-geon
to take it from them.

05:38.588 --> 05:39.630
Why did you…

05:40.339 --> 05:41.174
Where is it?

05:41.257 --> 05:43.051
He has it with him,

05:43.134 --> 05:45.011
but I can't reach him.
He must be on the run.

05:47.180 --> 05:50.475
I told you to let me know
as soon as you found the recorder!

05:53.853 --> 05:55.605
Why are you getting so worked up?

05:56.189 --> 05:57.607
It's not like you killed anyone.

06:01.861 --> 06:03.112
Do-kyung.

06:03.196 --> 06:04.405
Yes, I know.

06:05.448 --> 06:07.742
Finding the recorder is all good.

06:09.327 --> 06:11.621
But the process matters
more than the result itself.

06:11.704 --> 06:14.248
It's not good
to cause this kind of ruckus.

06:16.209 --> 06:18.795
Hurry and handle it quietly.

06:21.130 --> 06:22.090
Yes, Father.

06:22.840 --> 06:25.510
I'll tell him to bring it over
once I hear from him.

06:33.059 --> 06:34.060
Father.

06:35.394 --> 06:37.980
Is there anything
you're still hiding from me?

06:38.064 --> 06:39.148
What are you saying?

06:39.232 --> 06:40.483
It could be anything.

06:41.400 --> 06:43.528
If there is, please tell me now.

06:43.611 --> 06:46.739
I said no.
Stop asking the same question and get out!

06:58.751 --> 07:00.002
Goodness.

07:13.433 --> 07:15.184
It's been a long time, Chairman Yang.

07:16.477 --> 07:17.395
Chief Judge Choi.

07:18.271 --> 07:20.314
We must find Yoon Dae-myeong's recorder.

07:24.986 --> 07:27.447
Who has it?

07:27.530 --> 07:28.948
Lee Tae-geon.

07:30.950 --> 07:33.161
I'll send some
trustworthy police officers.

07:49.469 --> 07:52.180
I can't seem to loosen my grip.

07:53.014 --> 07:54.098
Maybe I'll starve myself.

07:54.891 --> 07:57.018
You said you run on food.

07:58.186 --> 08:00.730
Or maybe I should just snap my wrist.

08:01.481 --> 08:04.650
You want to beat me that much?
Why do you want to win so much?

08:05.234 --> 08:06.360
Because I like winning.

08:07.653 --> 08:09.614
Winners survive in the end.

08:10.823 --> 08:13.284
You know how they say
the process matters more than the result?

08:13.367 --> 08:16.537
Those are just empty words
to make you feel good.

08:17.580 --> 08:20.541
I rather like those empty words, though.

08:22.084 --> 08:25.213
The result is brief,
but the process lasts long.

08:25.296 --> 08:28.382
And through that tough process,
you learn lessons, gain insight,

08:28.466 --> 08:29.884
and grow up sometimes.

08:31.928 --> 08:32.970
Is that right?

08:35.056 --> 08:36.015
This is why

08:37.350 --> 08:40.353
I like you, Prosecutor Shin.

08:40.436 --> 08:43.523
You're pure,
and that's very rare these days.

08:44.815 --> 08:45.942
Cheers.

08:46.734 --> 08:48.819
You're the one who survived…

08:52.990 --> 08:55.034
but you still seem anxious.

09:00.665 --> 09:03.292
THE RED HOUSE

09:21.519 --> 09:22.645
Mr. Park,

09:23.354 --> 09:24.981
did you make sure to check it isn't salty?

09:25.064 --> 09:27.942
Yes, of course. It's not salty at all.

09:30.695 --> 09:31.779
Yes?

09:37.868 --> 09:38.869
Oh, sure.

09:40.371 --> 09:42.623
I understand. Please enjoy.

09:45.167 --> 09:46.002
Hello, sir.

09:47.211 --> 09:51.424
I'm Attorney Shin I-rang. I visited you
regarding Prosecutor Shin Gi-jung before.

09:52.008 --> 09:53.217
Oh, hello.

09:55.845 --> 09:59.056
Why don't we talk upstairs?

09:59.765 --> 10:00.725
Please follow me.

10:08.065 --> 10:10.276
You said Prosecutor Shin

10:10.359 --> 10:13.696
preyed on the small business owners
with the Four Dragons Gang, right?

10:14.280 --> 10:15.448
You lied, didn't you?

10:16.032 --> 10:19.160
Someone threatened you to lie to us.

10:20.036 --> 10:21.579
No.

10:22.246 --> 10:23.414
No one threatened me.

10:24.707 --> 10:27.168
What are you talking about?

10:27.877 --> 10:31.172
I asked those who ran businesses here
for a long time.

10:31.255 --> 10:34.467
They said Prosecutor Shin
rounded up the whole gang

10:34.550 --> 10:36.552
so that they could serve some good time.

10:39.847 --> 10:41.015
Mr. Attorney.

10:43.392 --> 10:44.226
Please.

10:45.686 --> 10:46.687
What…

10:47.647 --> 10:49.357
Why are you shaking so much, sir?

10:49.440 --> 10:51.942
I don't know anything.

10:54.278 --> 10:56.864
Please… leave for now.

10:56.947 --> 10:57.948
Sir.

10:58.699 --> 11:01.118
Trust us and tell us the truth.

11:03.162 --> 11:05.623
Did someone make you do it?

11:08.959 --> 11:11.796
Was it Lee Tae-geon, that nutcase?

11:16.133 --> 11:16.967
Hey.

11:18.010 --> 11:19.178
What?

11:21.680 --> 11:23.891
You must be the Four Dragons Gang,

11:24.600 --> 11:25.810
given how pissed you are.

11:26.394 --> 11:27.228
Attorney Shin,

11:27.978 --> 11:29.230
they're holding weapons.

11:30.898 --> 11:32.233
Yes, I know.

11:34.276 --> 11:35.319
I-rang.

11:50.334 --> 11:53.087
Rare item, obtained.

12:09.019 --> 12:11.313
Attorney Shin, don't take that with you.

12:11.397 --> 12:12.648
Oh, right. My bad.

12:19.822 --> 12:24.160
Finding out that Lee Tae-geon plans
to flee the country tonight is a big win.

12:24.994 --> 12:27.830
The problem is that
we don't know which port it is.

12:28.747 --> 12:30.499
Flee the country, huh?

12:33.002 --> 12:34.545
It's a long time ago,

12:36.338 --> 12:39.091
but the gang used to have
two major sources of income.

12:40.259 --> 12:41.635
CHINATOWN, STASH HOUSE

12:41.719 --> 12:46.390
Protection money
from the business owners in Chinatown,

12:47.057 --> 12:50.144
and illegal human smuggling
at Incheon Inner Harbor.

12:50.978 --> 12:52.229
Lee Tae-geon might…

12:52.313 --> 12:54.064
INCHEON INNER HARBOR

12:54.148 --> 12:55.483
…choose to take a safe route,

12:57.401 --> 12:59.028
Incheon Inner Harbor.

13:00.613 --> 13:01.780
Then, let's go there

13:02.573 --> 13:03.657
to get Lee Tae-geon.

13:13.125 --> 13:16.003
Wait five minutes after departure
and knock three times.

13:16.086 --> 13:17.588
Then, the captain will open the doors.

13:21.425 --> 13:22.426
Fine.

13:26.931 --> 13:29.099
Got it. You can go now.

13:45.491 --> 13:46.450
Wow.

13:51.413 --> 13:52.915
There are so many containers.

13:52.998 --> 13:54.708
How are we going to find him here?

13:55.292 --> 13:56.585
All the doors are locked too.

13:57.211 --> 13:58.170
You have me.

14:03.300 --> 14:04.510
That's so cool.

14:05.302 --> 14:06.303
What is it?

14:06.387 --> 14:08.597
My dad just went in there.

14:11.684 --> 14:12.810
I'll go this way.

14:14.353 --> 14:15.271
Attorney Han.

14:16.063 --> 14:18.566
Call me as soon as you find
anything suspicious.

14:18.649 --> 14:19.775
I will.

14:20.442 --> 14:21.402
Be careful.

15:13.162 --> 15:14.496
Hurry up.

15:15.456 --> 15:16.999
I'm dying to pee.

15:34.934 --> 15:37.102
Hey, Captain. Where are we?

15:41.607 --> 15:43.567
Isn't it obvious?

15:43.651 --> 15:45.486
You're on the road to hell.

15:57.122 --> 15:57.998
What?

15:59.959 --> 16:02.086
You gonna use that thing?

16:13.555 --> 16:14.431
Let's go.

16:27.861 --> 16:29.655
What… What is this?

16:30.698 --> 16:34.785
W-What are you trying to do, bastard?

16:34.868 --> 16:37.705
W-What do you think you're doing, punk?

16:38.330 --> 16:39.540
What…

16:39.623 --> 16:41.583
Who are you? Damn it!

16:45.379 --> 16:46.338
Me?

16:47.464 --> 16:48.590
Prosecutor Shin Gi-jung.

16:50.092 --> 16:51.051
Lee Tae-geon.

16:52.052 --> 16:54.763
Did you think you'd get away safely
after making a mess in my son's office?

16:56.849 --> 16:57.891
It can't be…

16:58.559 --> 16:59.560
Shin Gi-jung?

17:00.352 --> 17:01.395
No…

17:03.022 --> 17:05.274
Shin Gi-jung was killed back then.

17:06.025 --> 17:08.610
I couldn't rest in peace with you here,
so I came back.

17:10.904 --> 17:11.864
The recorder.

17:13.449 --> 17:14.450
Where is it?

17:15.034 --> 17:16.744
Screw you, ghost.

17:17.745 --> 17:19.288
I have no reason to tell you.

17:20.664 --> 17:21.999
If you don't,

17:22.708 --> 17:24.460
you'll be companions with me.

17:25.210 --> 17:26.045
Want to join me?

17:27.546 --> 17:28.464
What?

17:28.547 --> 17:29.590
Fine.

17:29.673 --> 17:32.342
Making a water ghost friend
doesn't sound so bad.

17:33.343 --> 17:34.303
What…

17:36.013 --> 17:37.931
What are you doing? What…

17:38.891 --> 17:39.808
Do I throw him in now?

17:40.350 --> 17:41.185
What?

17:44.438 --> 17:46.648
He isn't talking.
What's the use of dragging it out?

17:46.732 --> 17:47.983
It's cold.

17:50.152 --> 17:53.322
You think you can scare me?

17:56.492 --> 17:58.077
Why does that concern me?

17:58.994 --> 18:00.120
What?

18:04.083 --> 18:05.793
No. Don't!

18:06.585 --> 18:08.545
Yang Do-kyung! I gave it to Yang Do-kyung!

18:08.629 --> 18:11.924
I handed it to him
as soon as I left the office that day!

18:24.144 --> 18:24.978
Not a lie.

18:35.823 --> 18:37.491
Dead men tell no tales, after all.

18:58.595 --> 19:00.764
Now that it's in Yang Do-kyung's hands,

19:01.515 --> 19:02.724
it's game over.

19:03.308 --> 19:04.143
No.

19:05.519 --> 19:08.230
Yang Do-kyung didn't give it
to his father.

19:09.898 --> 19:12.651
He says Yang Do-kyung
didn't give it to his father.

19:15.529 --> 19:18.240
How do you know that, Dad?

19:18.323 --> 19:20.492
After Lee Tae-geon ran away,

19:21.118 --> 19:23.203
I quietly went to Taebaek.

19:24.079 --> 19:25.789
He has it with him,

19:25.873 --> 19:27.666
but I can't reach him.
He must be on the run.

19:28.876 --> 19:30.502
I wasn't aware then,

19:33.255 --> 19:34.882
but now that I put the pieces together,

19:34.965 --> 19:39.511
it was already after he got his hands
on the recorder.

19:40.721 --> 19:43.098
Yang Do-kyung acted like
he didn't have the recorder.

19:45.893 --> 19:47.978
But why?

19:48.061 --> 19:53.025
The recording must've been different
from what Yang Byung-il told him.

19:54.109 --> 19:57.946
Chairman Yang didn't trust his son
for a long time.

19:58.614 --> 20:02.367
It made Yang Do-kyung
resort to all kinds of means

20:02.451 --> 20:06.538
from tailing to wiretapping
to win his father's heart.

20:08.457 --> 20:13.545
And once again, he realized
that his father had no faith in him.

20:14.838 --> 20:17.591
Let me talk to him in person.

20:18.175 --> 20:19.509
I'll meet him

20:19.593 --> 20:22.179
and ask him
what he knows about his father.

20:23.597 --> 20:24.556
Okay.

20:39.905 --> 20:41.365
Did you find Lee Tae-geon?

20:41.448 --> 20:44.785
He seems to have
gotten caught by Shin I-rang.

20:47.037 --> 20:48.288
What now?

20:48.789 --> 20:51.250
Arrest Shin I-rang by any means possible.

20:51.333 --> 20:52.334
No matter what.

20:57.422 --> 20:58.257
The truth?

21:00.384 --> 21:01.510
Behind what?

21:01.593 --> 21:04.930
The truth behind Mr. Yoon Dae-myeong
and Prosecutor Shin Gi-jung.

21:06.265 --> 21:07.975
And how they were murdered.

21:09.351 --> 21:11.311
Did you lose your touch
after leaving Taebaek?

21:12.521 --> 21:15.274
Yoon Dae-myeong killed himself.
Shin Gi-jung died in a car accident.

21:16.191 --> 21:19.611
Why bother asking me things that
are clearly stated in the case records?

21:19.695 --> 21:21.655
You know

21:23.282 --> 21:24.741
the real truth.

21:27.953 --> 21:30.038
My father is innocent.

21:30.539 --> 21:31.790
That's the truth.

21:40.340 --> 21:41.258
What?

21:41.341 --> 21:44.011
What if you'd had someone
who accepted you for who you were

21:45.554 --> 21:48.307
and believed you to the end?

21:51.268 --> 21:52.978
You would've been very different from now.

21:55.689 --> 21:56.773
What are you trying to say?

21:56.857 --> 21:59.318
I mean, you need to put a stop to this.

22:01.528 --> 22:03.822
You must settle the Chairman's past,

22:05.157 --> 22:08.702
or your Taebaek will fall apart
even before it can begin.

22:10.287 --> 22:11.705
You don't want that, do you?

22:19.546 --> 22:23.050
SHIN I-RANG LAW OFFICE

22:23.675 --> 22:27.929
Yang Do-kyung wasn't interested
in telling the truth at all.

22:28.013 --> 22:29.931
Yang Byung-il must've heard

22:30.557 --> 22:33.226
that we caught Lee Tae-geon by now.

22:33.310 --> 22:34.770
In that case,

22:35.479 --> 22:38.523
Yang Byung-il might assume
that we have the recorder.

22:40.692 --> 22:44.780
If so, what would he do?

22:51.161 --> 22:53.246
If we're curious, let's just ask.

23:00.087 --> 23:02.089
Do you have time?

23:02.172 --> 23:04.174
I have something urgent to tell you.

23:04.257 --> 23:06.802
Nice timing.
I was meaning to reach you anyway.

23:06.885 --> 23:08.553
I have to tell you something too.

23:08.637 --> 23:10.430
I'll go to your office then.

23:13.558 --> 23:15.310
Don't go. It's dangerous.

23:15.936 --> 23:16.812
She's right, I-rang.

23:16.895 --> 23:19.606
He thinks you have the recorder.

23:19.689 --> 23:20.982
We don't know what he'll do.

23:24.653 --> 23:28.156
I'm well aware of your concern.

23:29.116 --> 23:32.619
But this is our only chance
to catch the tiger.

23:33.829 --> 23:37.124
I'll go find the answer we're looking for.

23:43.964 --> 23:45.465
TAEBAEK

24:00.480 --> 24:01.773
I'm Attorney Shin I-rang.

24:01.857 --> 24:02.899
Go on inside, sir.

24:02.983 --> 24:05.110
CHAIRMAN'S OFFICE
YANG BYUNG-IL

24:14.536 --> 24:16.037
Don't be scared, I-rang.

24:17.122 --> 24:19.833
So, you have something to tell me?

24:25.255 --> 24:26.506
Before that,

24:27.299 --> 24:29.426
I'd like to hear from you first.

24:32.304 --> 24:33.263
All right.

24:36.474 --> 24:37.434
There was…

24:39.436 --> 24:42.939
a reason why I didn't tell you
about Gi-jung's corruption.

24:43.690 --> 24:46.484
I was worried you'd lose your way

24:46.568 --> 24:49.112
because of your father's tainted past.

24:50.155 --> 24:51.698
After what happened to Gi-jung,

24:51.781 --> 24:54.868
I couldn't watch his only son
lose himself as well.

24:54.951 --> 24:58.288
Or maybe you were afraid
of the truth getting revealed.

24:59.623 --> 25:00.498
Go ahead.

25:01.208 --> 25:02.834
Resent me if you want.

25:03.627 --> 25:04.544
But,

25:05.587 --> 25:08.840
I just hope you don't misunderstand
my sincere intentions.

25:10.008 --> 25:12.427
I wanted to protect you,

25:14.888 --> 25:17.390
but now that I see, I was wrong.

25:21.186 --> 25:22.187
Mr. Shin I-rang.

25:24.606 --> 25:25.523
It's an arrest warrant.

25:26.566 --> 25:30.528
Lee Tae-geon and a few others
have sued you for assault.

25:32.948 --> 25:33.907
What?

25:33.990 --> 25:36.868
I asked them to let me
have a word with you first.

25:37.911 --> 25:39.955
I wanted to hear your excuse, at least.

25:41.373 --> 25:44.834
But I guess it's all meaningless now.

25:46.628 --> 25:47.545
Where did you hide it?

25:49.464 --> 25:50.298
Hide what?

25:54.135 --> 25:55.345
Oh.

25:57.097 --> 25:57.973
The recorder?

25:59.224 --> 26:00.350
That recorder…

26:01.059 --> 26:02.852
is with Attorney Yang Do-kyung.

26:02.936 --> 26:04.562
Don't try to pull any tricks.

26:04.646 --> 26:06.856
All you have to do is ask your son.

26:06.940 --> 26:08.400
I have no reason to lie.

26:17.450 --> 26:19.661
You were worried I would lose myself?

26:21.121 --> 26:23.832
I'm afraid you shouldn't be worrying
about someone else's son.

26:26.251 --> 26:29.212
You've got better things to worry about.

26:32.757 --> 26:35.927
Let's see if you can run your mouth
from the inside of a cell.

26:36.511 --> 26:37.429
Take him away.

26:44.144 --> 26:45.645
ONE HOUR AGO

26:47.188 --> 26:48.106
Come in.

26:50.650 --> 26:53.361
Oh, this is your office?

26:54.070 --> 26:55.071
What are you doing here?

26:55.822 --> 26:58.033
Sorry. I mistook it
for the Chairman's office.

27:00.618 --> 27:01.828
Wow.

27:02.454 --> 27:04.331
Your company is huge.

27:04.914 --> 27:06.207
Taebaek doesn't disappoint.

27:07.250 --> 27:09.878
Who says you can come here
and look for the Chairman's office?

27:10.628 --> 27:12.005
I'm here to meet him.

27:12.714 --> 27:13.548
My father? Why?

27:14.132 --> 27:16.217
He has something important to tell me.

27:16.926 --> 27:17.886
What exactly?

27:18.511 --> 27:20.221
Beats me.

27:22.057 --> 27:24.434
I'll leave you now.
Go back to what you were doing.

27:25.602 --> 27:26.811
Oh, right.

27:29.647 --> 27:30.732
That recorder

27:31.649 --> 27:33.693
is with you, isn't it?

27:35.653 --> 27:39.449
-What?
-It seems very important to the Chairman.

27:40.950 --> 27:42.494
Are you keeping it safe?

27:45.705 --> 27:49.000
Who knows?
It may have disappeared into thin air.

28:07.310 --> 28:08.603
Without a trace

28:09.687 --> 28:11.231
like a ghost.

28:17.570 --> 28:19.155
What the hell is with that guy?

29:16.629 --> 29:17.589
What?

29:18.381 --> 29:19.382
A blackout?

29:21.718 --> 29:24.137
We're actually suffering
from a blackout right now…

29:27.891 --> 29:30.727
Inside the Taebaek building miniature.
The pass code is 0-5-2-5.

29:33.521 --> 29:35.857
BONG-SU
INSIDE TAEBAEK BUILDING MINIATURE

29:44.407 --> 29:45.617
I'm Attorney Shin I-rang.

29:45.700 --> 29:46.701
Go on inside, sir.

29:46.785 --> 29:48.119
CHAIRMAN'S OFFICE
YANG BYUNG-IL

29:59.881 --> 30:01.466
Don't be scared, I-rang.

30:02.342 --> 30:05.303
So, you have something to tell me?

30:17.440 --> 30:19.317
I'm here about the blackout.
It won't take long.

30:19.400 --> 30:20.276
Okay.

30:38.628 --> 30:40.296
INSIDE TAEBAEK BUILDING MINIATURE
PASSCODE 0525

30:59.691 --> 31:00.942
Jackpot.

31:02.277 --> 31:04.529
All you have to do is ask your son.

31:04.612 --> 31:05.864
I have no reason to lie.

31:43.276 --> 31:45.278
Where is it? Where is the recorder?

31:45.904 --> 31:47.447
I kept it in here, but it's gone.

31:47.530 --> 31:48.448
What?

31:51.034 --> 31:52.368
Where is the recorder?

31:56.080 --> 31:57.749
It's Shin I-rang.

31:58.875 --> 32:01.336
Tell security
to stop everyone from getting out.

32:01.419 --> 32:02.337
Yes, sir.

32:05.089 --> 32:07.717
We have a problem.
You need to go to the lobby.

32:17.310 --> 32:20.021
PRESS CONFERENCE

32:20.104 --> 32:21.731
Today, I'm here

32:21.814 --> 32:25.735
to expose a serious criminal fact.

32:26.903 --> 32:28.363
Please wait a short moment.

32:37.872 --> 32:39.374
I'm Prosecutor Kim Hyeon-u.

32:39.958 --> 32:40.792
What is this about?

32:42.710 --> 32:45.296
-Well…
-You're not supposed to arrest him

32:45.380 --> 32:47.340
without taking proper steps, are you?

32:48.091 --> 32:49.550
Let me see the warrant.

33:06.734 --> 33:10.989
Here comes Chairman Yang Byung-il
and CEO Yang Do-kyung.

33:12.365 --> 33:13.449
Chairman Yang.

33:19.580 --> 33:21.541
What are you doing?
Are you out of your mind?

33:21.624 --> 33:22.959
No, absolutely not.

33:24.711 --> 33:26.004
This won't change anything.

33:26.587 --> 33:27.922
It will change everything.

33:30.091 --> 33:31.759
Thank you for your patience.

33:32.385 --> 33:36.681
Let us now reveal the truth
behind Chairman Yang Byung-il.

33:36.764 --> 33:39.851
But first,
let me introduce Attorney Shin I-rang.

33:59.412 --> 34:00.288
I am

34:01.205 --> 34:04.250
the son of a corrupt prosecutor.

34:07.587 --> 34:09.756
Some call him a crooked prosecutor.

34:10.465 --> 34:12.800
Some remember him
as an upright prosecutor.

34:14.677 --> 34:15.970
Prosecutor Shin Gi-jung.

34:17.472 --> 34:18.431
He is

34:19.640 --> 34:20.975
my father.

34:27.106 --> 34:29.317
Twenty years ago,

34:30.359 --> 34:34.197
my father was framed for targeting
Mr. Yoon Dae-myeong for investigation

34:34.280 --> 34:35.948
and driving him to commit suicide.

34:36.616 --> 34:38.701
When he died,

34:38.785 --> 34:42.455
his body tested positive for narcotics
mixed with cannabis hallucinogens.

34:42.538 --> 34:46.042
And many traces of corruption
were found in his office.

34:46.709 --> 34:49.629
However, it was all fake.

34:51.422 --> 34:53.674
And the whole thing was fabricated

34:55.676 --> 34:56.511
by Taebaek's…

34:59.388 --> 35:00.807
Chairman Yang Byung-il.

35:01.599 --> 35:03.142
That crazy bastard.

35:03.226 --> 35:04.852
Father, reporters are watching.

35:11.567 --> 35:13.402
Now, let me reveal

35:13.486 --> 35:17.281
the voices that held the truth
from 20 years ago.

35:18.074 --> 35:19.659
One is Yang Byung-il,

35:19.742 --> 35:22.870
and the other is the current Chief Judge,

35:22.954 --> 35:24.247
Choi Chang-su.

35:27.125 --> 35:30.169
I'm going to lure Yoon Dae-myeong
to Incheon first.

35:30.837 --> 35:34.924
A despicable vice-principal who committed
suicide out of mental pressure.

35:35.633 --> 35:37.468
That's what he'll be described as.

35:37.552 --> 35:39.220
Good work.

35:40.304 --> 35:44.600
What are you going to do
about your uptight junior prosecutor?

35:45.184 --> 35:48.479
He's not one to let go until the very end.

35:49.105 --> 35:51.440
He'll get into a car accident.

35:51.524 --> 35:54.902
His career will end
as a corrupt, drug-addicted prosecutor.

35:56.279 --> 36:01.576
Then, Shin Gi-jung will vanish quietly
as a corrupt prosecutor.

36:02.535 --> 36:05.163
Dead men tell no tales, after all.

36:13.838 --> 36:14.839
This…

36:16.632 --> 36:18.968
was recorded
when Mr. Yoon Dae-myeong was still alive.

36:19.719 --> 36:20.678
Of course,

36:20.761 --> 36:23.723
I know this evidence is inadmissible.

36:25.224 --> 36:26.517
But I believe

36:28.186 --> 36:29.437
the truth will be revealed

36:30.229 --> 36:31.814
no matter how long it takes

36:32.815 --> 36:33.816
for sure.

36:49.373 --> 36:52.960
This case is now out of my hands.

36:54.337 --> 36:57.632
Please investigate it properly.

37:02.386 --> 37:03.387
I will.

37:10.561 --> 37:11.437
Take him in.

37:13.981 --> 37:16.400
Chairman Yang Byung-il,
please say a word about the recording.

37:16.484 --> 37:19.695
Is it true you instigated the murder
of Yoon Dae-myeong and Shin Gi-jung?

37:22.698 --> 37:24.951
Is it true you hid it
for more than 20 years?

37:41.050 --> 37:43.344
It took such a long time.

37:47.473 --> 37:48.849
Attorney Shin I-rang.

37:53.312 --> 37:54.272
Thank you.

38:10.121 --> 38:11.998
The reporters all left.

38:12.707 --> 38:17.003
We'll get really busy doing interviews
and answering questions starting tomorrow.

38:19.547 --> 38:22.550
All this was possible thanks to you.

38:23.134 --> 38:25.052
You went through a lot.

38:26.304 --> 38:27.513
Thank you.

38:30.891 --> 38:33.602
Let's hurry and go
so we can rest up today.

38:45.114 --> 38:46.949
They won't let us rest until tomorrow.

38:47.533 --> 38:49.994
I know. They don't give us a break.

38:52.496 --> 38:55.124
Do you want some of this to recharge?

38:57.126 --> 38:58.919
COFFEE CANDY

38:59.003 --> 39:00.087
Sure.

39:08.971 --> 39:09.847
What a pick-me-up.

39:11.098 --> 39:12.558
It makes my eyes wide open.

39:17.396 --> 39:18.731
Let's go wrap things up.

39:24.195 --> 39:25.821
Moving on to the next report.

39:25.905 --> 39:27.948
Chairman Yang Byung-il of Taebaek Law Firm

39:28.532 --> 39:29.825
was pointed out as the mastermind

39:29.909 --> 39:33.496
behind Yoon Dae-myeong
and Shin Gi-jung's deaths in 2003,

39:33.579 --> 39:35.498
and the prosecution
arrested and prosecuted him

39:35.581 --> 39:38.667
on suspicion of instigating murder
and destroying evidence.

39:38.751 --> 39:40.753
The details are as follows.

39:40.836 --> 39:44.131
Chairman Yang Byung-il was detained
at Nambu Detention Center this morning.

39:44.715 --> 39:47.927
The prosecution is focusing
on investigating him on charges

39:48.010 --> 39:50.221
of instigating murder and
tampering with evidence.

39:50.304 --> 39:53.766
They've also announced plans
to summon Chief Judge Choi Chang-su

39:53.849 --> 39:56.352
on suspicion of instigating defamation.

39:56.435 --> 39:58.771
YONGJIN DELIVERY

40:00.648 --> 40:03.401
CHOI CHANG-SU AND YANG BYUNG-IL
TO BE INTERROGATED TOMORROW MORNING

40:04.443 --> 40:05.361
Father…

40:06.404 --> 40:09.115
SHIN GI-JUNG'S BEREAVED SAYS,
"THE TRUTH MUST BE REVEALED TO THE END"

40:23.963 --> 40:26.340
Why did you come?
I have no business with you, I-rang.

40:28.092 --> 40:29.135
I have…

40:31.512 --> 40:33.013
something to tell you,

40:36.183 --> 40:37.143
Byung-il.

40:38.978 --> 40:39.979
Prosecutor Shin?

40:47.319 --> 40:49.655
I was waiting for you.
I expected you'd come.

40:49.738 --> 40:51.282
Why did you do that to me?

40:56.036 --> 40:57.455
What made you…

40:59.832 --> 41:01.041
change so much?

41:01.125 --> 41:03.461
I've always been like this.
You just didn't know it.

41:03.544 --> 41:04.753
No.

41:05.421 --> 41:07.381
From what I remember,
you weren't like this.

41:10.259 --> 41:12.720
This isn't who you are!

41:18.142 --> 41:19.059
I…

41:20.895 --> 41:22.855
realized one particular thing

41:24.231 --> 41:25.649
while practicing kendo.

41:27.109 --> 41:29.153
That if the other is
faster and stronger than me,

41:29.236 --> 41:31.530
I must break the rules to win.

41:33.032 --> 41:36.202
Play within the rules,
and you'll eventually fall behind.

41:36.994 --> 41:38.412
Like you, Gi-jung.

41:40.456 --> 41:41.624
So…

41:44.627 --> 41:45.836
So…

41:47.004 --> 41:51.133
was it satisfying to run ahead
by breaking the rule…

41:54.011 --> 41:55.304
and trampling on others?

41:55.387 --> 41:58.224
You ended up dying
because you were naive.

42:05.773 --> 42:07.608
It's not too late.

42:08.651 --> 42:11.028
Admit to all your crimes.

42:12.947 --> 42:15.324
Apologize to me,

42:15.950 --> 42:17.952
my family,

42:20.871 --> 42:21.956
and Mr. Yoon's family.

42:24.083 --> 42:25.084
Apologize?

42:26.460 --> 42:28.087
If I had intended to apologize,

42:28.170 --> 42:31.048
I wouldn't have done it
in the first place.

42:32.841 --> 42:33.842
I see…

42:36.512 --> 42:38.347
you have no sense of self-reflection

42:39.974 --> 42:41.100
or regret.

42:48.315 --> 42:50.693
I have just one regret.

42:51.819 --> 42:54.238
The fact that I failed.

42:59.493 --> 43:02.162
I can't believe I let a ghost trip me up.

43:05.040 --> 43:07.209
You seriously are sickening.

43:09.628 --> 43:12.506
You came to meet me even after your death.

43:14.758 --> 43:18.596
We'll never meet again.

43:21.557 --> 43:22.641
You and I

43:24.184 --> 43:25.352
are going to

43:26.562 --> 43:27.813
different places.

44:10.564 --> 44:12.691
Da-bong, can you do a good job?

44:12.775 --> 44:13.692
Yes.

44:15.444 --> 44:16.612
KOREAN BEEF AND PORK SPECIALTY
PITTER-PATTER…

44:16.695 --> 44:19.239
Dad, are you ready?

44:19.323 --> 44:20.658
Will it be okay?

44:20.741 --> 44:23.202
Of course. We're all family.

44:27.790 --> 44:28.916
All right.

44:29.667 --> 44:30.751
I'm ready.

44:42.971 --> 44:44.598
It's okay. I opened it only for a second.

44:45.349 --> 44:48.560
Goodness. I-rang acted like
he'd be here soon, but he's not here yet.

44:56.068 --> 44:58.487
Welcome home. Go wash your hands…

45:02.408 --> 45:03.992
Say hello to your uncle, Da-bong.

45:04.076 --> 45:05.661
Hi, Uncle.

45:11.834 --> 45:14.169
I bet she's reminded of Dad a lot.

45:14.253 --> 45:16.755
Why don't you go comfort her
and bring her back out?

45:20.634 --> 45:22.469
Okay, sweetheart.

45:24.763 --> 45:26.515
"Okay, sweetheart"?

45:45.534 --> 45:46.952
Is it you, honey?

45:52.708 --> 45:54.668
You probably look the same.

45:58.589 --> 46:00.382
I'm quite aged, aren't I?

46:01.633 --> 46:04.094
You're always the same in my eyes,
Gyeong-hwa.

46:06.763 --> 46:09.016
For surviving all these years…

46:10.017 --> 46:12.769
For being alive in this world…

46:14.730 --> 46:17.191
you don't know how grateful I am.

46:42.716 --> 46:43.926
Thank you so much.

46:51.600 --> 46:52.684
Thank you.

47:03.612 --> 47:06.823
The tastes good too.
Gosh, so is the kimchi.

47:07.407 --> 47:08.242
Indeed,

47:09.493 --> 47:12.287
no one can make this better than your mom.

47:15.165 --> 47:16.875
I can't believe it still tastes the same.

47:19.294 --> 47:22.714
Sa-rang, have some vegetables too.

47:23.340 --> 47:24.883
But I don't like bell peppers.

47:26.051 --> 47:27.261
Gosh.

47:29.680 --> 47:32.099
And you shouldn't use just one chopstick.

47:32.182 --> 47:34.935
Sausages are too slippery.
It's not easy to pick them.

47:36.311 --> 47:38.313
Take your time.

47:39.398 --> 47:42.317
Watch. Push one to a corner
so it can't slip away.

47:42.985 --> 47:44.069
And pick it up like this.

47:45.654 --> 47:46.530
Sa-rang.

47:47.656 --> 47:48.699
Use two chopsticks, okay?

47:49.950 --> 47:52.494
Maybe you're good at using chopsticks
because you're left-handed.

47:53.036 --> 47:53.954
The truth is,

47:54.830 --> 47:56.123
I'm…

47:56.206 --> 47:58.375
both-handed!

47:58.458 --> 47:59.710
Here, your veggies.

48:01.795 --> 48:03.005
I-rang.

48:03.088 --> 48:04.506
It really is good.

48:09.720 --> 48:10.762
Sa-rang.

48:11.346 --> 48:13.765
Here. Eat up.

48:16.643 --> 48:17.728
Don't be picky.

48:21.732 --> 48:22.608
Dad?

48:26.361 --> 48:27.321
Dad.

48:41.543 --> 48:42.794
It's you.

48:45.088 --> 48:46.089
Dad…

48:52.721 --> 48:53.764
I…

48:55.015 --> 48:56.975
I missed you so much, Dad.

49:02.022 --> 49:02.981
Me too.

49:05.067 --> 49:06.735
I missed you so much too.

49:14.743 --> 49:16.078
My sweet daughter.

49:29.091 --> 49:32.302
Honey, Sa-rang must've had
something spicy.

49:33.053 --> 49:36.306
-She's a blubbering mess.
-When I was little, my dad said…

49:36.390 --> 49:37.391
Have some jeon.

49:37.474 --> 49:40.310
…that some truths are
harder to believe than lies.

49:40.394 --> 49:41.853
Make sure you eat it all.

49:42.604 --> 49:43.522
I'll help myself.

49:43.605 --> 49:46.983
But the truth
earned through grueling times

49:47.067 --> 49:48.819
is stronger than anything else.

49:53.865 --> 49:54.950
All it takes is

49:55.659 --> 49:59.705
one person to believe in you

49:59.788 --> 50:02.249
to conquer any obstacle.

50:03.917 --> 50:06.294
Even if the whole world
has no faith in you,

50:06.378 --> 50:08.130
you can muster up the courage

50:08.797 --> 50:10.507
for that one person.

50:11.633 --> 50:13.301
I'm that person to you.

50:13.885 --> 50:16.346
No matter what happens,
I'll believe you until the end.

50:20.851 --> 50:23.937
Dad, let me officially
introduce him to you.

50:24.020 --> 50:26.982
This is your son-in-law, Yoon Bong-su.

50:27.566 --> 50:29.025
Oh…

50:29.109 --> 50:30.402
Nice to meet--

50:30.485 --> 50:34.573
We've met before,
but let me officially introduce myself.

50:34.656 --> 50:37.367
I'm Sa-rang's husband

50:37.451 --> 50:38.910
and your son-in-law,

50:38.994 --> 50:41.079
Yoon Bong-su.

50:42.122 --> 50:45.959
Father. Allow me to pour you a glass
in that sense.

50:46.460 --> 50:47.461
-Will you?
-Yes.

50:49.421 --> 50:50.338
Son-in-law…

50:52.048 --> 50:54.926
-Give my daughter lots of love.
-Yes, sir.

50:55.927 --> 50:57.179
Why don't we clink together?

50:57.262 --> 50:59.097
-Sure.
-Cheers.

50:59.181 --> 51:01.183
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

51:16.823 --> 51:18.658
Beyond longing and worth,

51:19.367 --> 51:22.954
there was a deep understanding
that required no words.

51:23.997 --> 51:26.124
And before we knew it,

51:26.208 --> 51:28.251
our family became one.

51:29.878 --> 51:34.883
CHAIRMAN YANG BYUNG-IL

52:17.050 --> 52:19.761
Dad is standing right here.

52:20.679 --> 52:21.721
Oh.

52:22.430 --> 52:25.183
Father, please don't worry.

52:25.267 --> 52:28.228
I'll take good care of the family.

52:28.311 --> 52:31.147
I'm grateful that I got to meet you
and say goodbye at least like this.

52:31.690 --> 52:34.901
Please take good care
of Sa-rang and yourself.

52:36.152 --> 52:39.656
He says you should cut down on drinking
and be good to Sa-rang.

52:41.783 --> 52:43.493
Okay, I will.

52:44.369 --> 52:45.287
This way?

52:51.042 --> 52:52.085
Dad.

52:54.087 --> 52:56.590
Can't you just stay?

52:57.674 --> 53:02.095
I still have so much
I want to do with you.

53:04.097 --> 53:06.600
I'm sorry I couldn't do better for you.

53:07.517 --> 53:08.768
My dear Sa-rang,

53:11.271 --> 53:12.689
thank you

53:13.732 --> 53:14.983
for being my daughter.

53:15.567 --> 53:16.526
Dad.

53:17.360 --> 53:19.654
Will we be able to meet again?

53:20.155 --> 53:21.573
We'll meet again, right?

53:22.699 --> 53:23.617
Of course.

53:24.200 --> 53:26.786
After a long, long time.

53:30.582 --> 53:32.792
We'll meet again with smiles on our faces.

53:35.295 --> 53:36.630
Okay, Dad.

53:37.839 --> 53:39.007
Dad…

53:41.885 --> 53:42.969
Dad…

53:54.773 --> 53:59.277
I was happy that I got to enjoy your food
as much as I wanted.

54:00.904 --> 54:03.073
Thank you for coming.

54:06.493 --> 54:07.619
Farewell.

54:14.876 --> 54:16.962
I-rang, take good care of your mom,

54:17.712 --> 54:20.840
Sa-rang, and the others.
Be their rock for me.

54:22.550 --> 54:23.510
I love

54:25.261 --> 54:26.304
our family

54:27.597 --> 54:28.723
so, so much.

54:34.104 --> 54:34.938
Yes.

54:36.982 --> 54:38.483
I'll keep them safe from now on.

54:39.401 --> 54:40.568
Don't worry.

54:42.612 --> 54:45.490
Dad says he loves

54:46.408 --> 54:47.951
all our family so much.

54:49.369 --> 54:50.453
Dad…

54:51.705 --> 54:53.206
Dad…

55:15.979 --> 55:18.940
Dad…

55:21.609 --> 55:23.445
Dad…

55:25.363 --> 55:26.448
Dad.

56:14.746 --> 56:16.623
You have no idea how proud I am

56:17.874 --> 56:19.876
to be your son.

56:22.462 --> 56:23.671
Rest in peace now.

56:48.154 --> 56:49.948
CURRENTLY IN 2026
LAW OFFICE

56:50.031 --> 56:51.866
NA-HYUN, I-RANG
LAW OFFICE

57:21.104 --> 57:23.940
SHIN I-RANG LAW OFFICE

58:38.556 --> 58:39.599
Hello.

58:41.518 --> 58:42.602
Nice to meet you.

58:43.311 --> 58:44.979
Can you see me?

58:45.688 --> 58:46.523
Yes.

58:47.815 --> 58:49.817
I will help you find who you are,

58:49.901 --> 58:52.237
discover what kind of story
brought you here,

58:52.904 --> 58:55.365
and eventually,
pass on with no resentment.

58:56.074 --> 58:57.200
I'm Attorney Shin I-rang.

58:59.035 --> 59:02.121
First, we need to sign a contract.

59:03.623 --> 59:06.960
But you see,
I have a very important appointment today.

59:07.544 --> 59:10.171
Do you mind
if we meet again here tomorrow?

59:10.755 --> 59:11.631
Well,

59:11.714 --> 59:13.258
-we can do that.
-Good.

01:00:11.649 --> 01:00:12.817
Did you wait long?

01:00:13.610 --> 01:00:15.778
No, I arrived just a while ago.

01:00:24.078 --> 01:00:25.330
It took us

01:00:26.247 --> 01:00:27.790
such a long time to come here.

01:00:28.499 --> 01:00:29.542
I understand.

01:00:30.251 --> 01:00:32.587
What can you do?
Ghosts visit you all the time.

01:00:33.171 --> 01:00:34.380
Don't worry.

01:00:34.464 --> 01:00:37.592
A new ghost client came earlier,

01:00:37.675 --> 01:00:39.969
and I flat-out said not today.

01:00:42.096 --> 01:00:43.222
That's a relief.

01:00:50.813 --> 01:00:51.773
Attorney Han.

01:00:53.066 --> 01:00:55.443
I've always wanted to tell you

01:00:56.277 --> 01:00:57.153
that I…

01:01:14.295 --> 01:01:15.380
No.

01:01:16.798 --> 01:01:17.882
Attorney Shin?

01:01:18.675 --> 01:01:20.635
Attorney Han, do you trust me?

01:01:22.011 --> 01:01:23.721
-Yes.
-Then, run.

01:02:36.377 --> 01:02:37.754
They look good on you.

01:02:39.797 --> 01:02:42.842
I've been meaning to tell you

01:02:44.427 --> 01:02:45.511
that you look pretty.

01:02:50.850 --> 01:02:51.851
Thank you…

01:02:54.103 --> 01:02:56.022
for believing me
even when you didn't see what I saw

01:02:57.273 --> 01:02:58.691
and keeping my side

01:03:00.401 --> 01:03:01.861
even when you couldn't understand.

01:03:03.404 --> 01:03:06.491
The one who taught me
it was time to find my courage,

01:03:08.075 --> 01:03:09.202
was you, Na-hyun.

01:03:10.453 --> 01:03:11.913
I'm more grateful.

01:03:16.000 --> 01:03:17.919
I was running forward
without looking back,

01:03:19.170 --> 01:03:20.797
but you made me stop.

01:03:23.424 --> 01:03:25.092
You have no idea

01:03:25.718 --> 01:03:27.345
how much warmer my world has become…

01:03:29.430 --> 01:03:31.641
after meeting you.

01:03:46.739 --> 01:03:47.740
No.

01:03:50.618 --> 01:03:51.828
Not now.

01:03:53.204 --> 01:03:54.413
What?

01:04:11.347 --> 01:04:12.682
Merry Christmas.

01:04:58.895 --> 01:05:00.855
SPECIAL THANKS
TO CHOI WON-YOUNG AND JUNG JAE-SUNG

01:05:19.373 --> 01:05:25.129
EPILOGUE

01:05:32.136 --> 01:05:34.180
Huh? Where'd you come from?

01:05:35.681 --> 01:05:37.183
How adorable.

01:05:38.726 --> 01:05:40.436
How did you get in here?

01:05:41.479 --> 01:05:43.481
Good dog.

01:05:44.106 --> 01:05:46.359
It's all right. Come here.

01:05:46.442 --> 01:05:47.652
Uncle!

01:05:47.735 --> 01:05:49.195
Da-bong!

01:05:51.072 --> 01:05:52.365
Here you are.

01:05:54.408 --> 01:05:56.911
Were you by yourself?

01:05:56.994 --> 01:05:58.829
You were talking to someone just now.

01:05:58.913 --> 01:05:59.914
Oh.

01:06:01.499 --> 01:06:03.459
A lost dog came in.

01:06:04.043 --> 01:06:05.127
Where is it?

01:06:05.211 --> 01:06:06.921
Oh. It's right here.

01:06:11.968 --> 01:06:13.052
I-rang.

01:06:30.236 --> 01:06:31.070
No…

01:06:43.249 --> 01:06:44.750
Uncle?

01:07:55.738 --> 01:07:59.575
Subtitle translation by: Eunjin Erica Kim
